        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37aaf30196600b248981ee89fdb7e2e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329274853
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5a65686633c14d2c8e4fa56d70fbc6d4
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623126046329274854
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ec3e178f3ed14b4798e0dd644a61d23d
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A fire. Sit down, all of you, and get your breath back. Whatever is out there will still be there when we are done.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274855
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: cad7f700a3504c68a162d21f14888680
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: At first light we find the four who went ahead. Ingrid. Bjarne. Tor. And...
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274856
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 906c29bd713f44dfa7e71cdaf7545e6f
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>She stops. Her lips move, and nothing comes.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274857
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5d1527cbc5b34e5186ca426577351606
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Liv.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274858
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0124ef98712e4460aa16eb6499948b72
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Liv. Of course. Eleven years I have known her, and for a moment there was a hole where her name should be.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274859
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3c3d6f488cc9470fb941eb6ff9554a6e
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37aaf30196600b248981ee89fdb7e2e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329274860
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 67b41a6da58f4c1d81ea07a45dc4ad75
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        seconds: 3
    - rid: 2623126046329274861
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 901f3052b7f24f7bb55286e0404e9a24
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: It is this place. At the tree line I had to think for my own sister's name. I did not like to say.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274862
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8511d60a5a9e461ab0031b252522befa
        position: {x: 3340, y: 60}
