  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126046329274818
      type: {class: WhenQuestEvent, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c0b05366aad1459c9e681fe99b2ca401
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7d3f1e76eaac0c4093ec068db341d61, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329274819
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 055a32571e1b4283ba5216fa1e946bea
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 2623126046329274820
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 85dcffce513b4478a9200066973eec77
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>Sigrid lays her palm flat on the centre stone and holds it there. Nothing. The stone stays cold.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274821
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ffe7ed80f0b7408791a24d70f243c05a
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: It will not wake for me. It never has. You, then. Put your hand on the centre stone.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274822
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: f9d5641f732a48e4b144dfefcbf50dd6
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82ba4d914072adf478d4fa857f205026, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329274823
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8cef536ed2cf48b78ec16292ef58ddad
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: You asked me by the fire, so here it is. I have seen stones like these wake once. It took everyone who stood too near, and it put them somewhere else. Ingrid knew that when she came. Now you do.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274824
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9894e289f2044497a369c0514eb59c35
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone. There are things I should have told you, and there is no time left to tell them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329274825
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 92d5bbddb5654893842d4f706795f8e3
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 316e769a318ba5a44b33770cbaf45924, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329274826
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d4af57772a044f338c9391272ca5a97d
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: <i>The same marks as the stone by the lake, and the same warmth. It was already awake this morning.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
