    - rid: 2623126046329275002
      type: {class: GiveItemsNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0f67d9ac4e704b7688915a0380a81bd2
        position: {x: 1240, y: 740}
        items:
        - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99887c135c70abc40aae37cfc66809b9, type: 2}
          amount: 1
        - item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 14b1c5230b317074b8251810d5264494, type: 2}
          amount: 30
        equip: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329275003
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 44813aad94894c3895df4662778f5339
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A soldier's choice. It is old iron, but it holds an edge. Guard well and let them come to you.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275004
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a03cf489c84346aa882ba1f49440552c
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275005
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ec1290e7d4484d6ca95cb30d1ea98d08
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and it leaves you a hand free.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275006
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7e5d47bb961546a5b46abab2f9fe9d42
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275007
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 77bf57570d554207960597d7f66f2291
        position: {x: 1540, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Long reach, and it wants both hands. If you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275008
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 118cc3b68fbc4e24a1e86fb6820dc432
        position: {x: 1840, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275009
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 292761de28754f14b6d3b21ebacc9bd2
        position: {x: 1540, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Simple. I respect that. Hit it until it stops, and it leaves you a hand free.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275010
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4df45032a478471ca14bef02c2a9ef39
        position: {x: 1840, y: 570}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275011
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: dcb69b14303c449e8a0945ecfcdceb41
        position: {x: 1540, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: 'A bow! Then there are two of us. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot. It wants both hands: if you ever need a light instead, press L to swap them.'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275012
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
