    - rid: 2623126046329274782
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1cedfa205d07449e8f63e8d610db1bde
        position: {x: 640, y: 570}
        reaches: 0.05
    - rid: 2623126046329274783
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3b5f37344aab44eb86b7e762e7208347
        position: {x: 940, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Steady now. It is a fine morning to walk into something stupid.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274784
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9dd05efef33c439d863dd4167a4a91cf
        position: {x: 640, y: 740}
        reaches: 0.3
    - rid: 2623126046329274785
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e8b0381b3b42498990a89523d985b4d8
        position: {x: 940, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A shepherd told me his dogs won't go past the tree line any more. Dogs. I have seen those dogs go after a bear.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274786
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 07a560257d46403abcfe3bdbd6efcab2
        position: {x: 640, y: 910}
        reaches: 0.58
    - rid: 2623126046329274787
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9cd588dd56e94d07ab0858cd5e6418bb
        position: {x: 940, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Rumours grow in the telling. That is why we go and look, instead of sitting in a longhouse and listening.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274788
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9654337e9f3e4f919af0678fdc1657be
        position: {x: 640, y: 1080}
        reaches: 0.85
    - rid: 2623126046329274789
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ffe8c52eabd449499c960104ad01b010
        position: {x: 940, y: 910}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Is it past noon already? We have not been walking an hour.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274790
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2584dd27a74746fe9abab58da109e8d7
        position: {x: 940, y: 1080}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Hold up. That's Bjarne's handcart, tipped off the road. Have a look; I'll watch the trees.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274791
      type: {class: WaitForEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4eda3b16854342058efe2a42ae938f75
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1822e4f3d74228b489493e550b28c6ca, type: 2}
        orAfterSeconds: 25
    - rid: 2623126046329274792
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8b3e84fa16fa4936a348cb9e17653f68
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Boar, running flat out, and not from us. Off the road!
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329274793
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 84167f668ad947328fb9e7e1f9e03bf7
        position: {x: 1540, y: 230}
        seconds: 5
    - rid: 2623126046329274794
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6578a541bdec4d9f93403819c85bfdfc
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Wolves behind them! In the open, in daylight. They don't do that. Weapons!
