  - from: 1dac48c63a194c5aba1163af82300be4
    output: 0
    to: abcb368047a3419bbdbc54e7537de840
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126046329275049
      type: {class: WhenQuest, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 77173c14c76a41aeb12704da0e6353f9
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 0
        quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3514f440e604ac048bb77179757dee9b, type: 2}
        when: 0
        alsoAfterLoading: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329275050
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4f6acef40b7247a88f749d605cc17426
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 367a938ebe0a9f847806fbc01218a5e2, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275051
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8fd3271ec23c4253af71fc403e8351ac
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        seconds: 0.4
    - rid: 2623126046329275052
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 25e58c45bd454259a1cacb2f4ccdaa22
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: 'For anyone who slept through last night''s talk, and I know who you are: I am Sigrid, and we walk east today. The villages asked what is wrong in that forest. Two days ago I sent Ingrid, Bjarne, Tor and Liv ahead to look. They should have been back yesterday.'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275053
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 85a9137fca7349b7a6faf73e3ad9f014
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Eirik. Twenty winters in the shield wall at Granheim. I walk in front, I carry the heavy things and I make sure everyone eats. There is porridge. It is bad.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275054
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 893a2f985d504b11a1cbbbbde08ade29
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Runa. I find the tracks, and I shoot what makes them. Trolls off their crags, witches on the roads, wolves that don't run from fire. I want to see it for myself before I believe any of it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275055
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2e62dff070644e7481557320450c5068
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: And you. You came to us with a strong back and few questions. Nobody walks towards that forest by accident. Why are you here?
        answers:
        - For the coin.
        - Someone I know went in there.
        - To see if the stories are true.
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623126046329275056
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 547bdc3af7db4342b62e717461a8b57f
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 052e1548b0a161348bb7cf591b4333f7, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275057
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4e3d06b4637544f5b6e6b165aff69ffd
        position: {x: 2140, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a0301acf429304ba7ad3d189da48bb, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275058
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 86f5caf12e98441eb885c2c6c2b9efb3
        position: {x: 2140, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1426971087cd5fb408c55293cb5e4e12, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126046329275059
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 70527e11212f49c497d3fd2194c51af7
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: An honest answer. I like you already.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275060
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ba66ccd56cce4d7796b149639cdb73b9
        position: {x: 2440, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Then we are after the same thing. We will find them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275061
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9ac664d5e2f34f39aae64a0c2a8b5bd3
        position: {x: 2440, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Careful. The ones who go looking for the truth of it are the ones who find it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275062
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1dac48c63a194c5aba1163af82300be4
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: We leave when you are ready. If you want to earn your porridge first, ask the others. They always have something.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126046329275063
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: abcb368047a3419bbdbc54e7537de840
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 367a938ebe0a9f847806fbc01218a5e2, type: 2}
